# Payment Gateway Architecture (Local & International)

## Overview

የፕሮጀክታችን ዓላማ በኢትዮጵያ ብቻ የተገደበ document conversion service መፍጠር ሳይሆን፣ ወደፊት international users መደገፍ የሚችል SaaS document platform መገንባት ነው።

ስለዚህ payment system ከመጀመሪያው ተለዋዋጭ (flexible) እና ለወደፊት expansion የሚዘጋጅ ይሆናል።

---

# Payment Strategy

System አንድ payment gateway ብቻ አይጠቀምም።

የሚኖረው:

```text
User Payment Request

        ↓

Payment Router Layer

        ↓

--------------------------------

Local Payment

Telebirr


International Payments

Paddle
PayPal
Other Global Gateways

--------------------------------

        ↓

Payment Verification

        ↓

Service Access
```

---

# 1. Telebirr (Local Payment)

## Purpose

Telebirr ለመጀመሪያው የEthiopian market launch የሚጠቀምበት local payment option ነው።

## Use Cases

* Ethiopian users
* ETB payments
* Small service access fees
* Document conversion payments

## Flow

```text
Ethiopian User

↓

Telebirr Payment

↓

Backend Verification

↓

Conversion Service Unlock
```

## Advantages

* Local user familiarity
* Ethiopian currency support
* Easy local payment experience

---

# 2. Paddle (International SaaS Payment)

## Purpose

Paddle ለ international SaaS expansion የሚጠቅም digital product payment platform ነው።

## Use Cases

* Global document service users
* Future subscriptions
* SaaS plans
* International billing

## Flow

```text
International User

↓

Paddle Checkout

↓

Payment Confirmation

↓

Backend Verification

↓

Service Access
```

## Advantages

* Designed for software/SaaS products
* Supports digital service billing
* Future subscription model support

---

# 3. PayPal (International Payment Option)

## Purpose

PayPal በዓለም የታወቀ international payment method ስለሆነ ለglobal users ተጨማሪ payment option ሊሆን ይችላል።

## Use Cases

* Users who prefer PayPal
* International digital payments
* Additional checkout option

## Flow

```text
International User

↓

PayPal Payment

↓

Backend Verification

↓

Service Access
```

## Advantages

* High user trust
* Global recognition
* Common payment method

