# Payment Router Architecture

Backend ውስጥ payment systems በseparate layer ይደራጃሉ።

Example:

```text
backend/

src/

services/

paymentService.js

        |

        ├── telebirrService.js

        ├── paddleService.js

        └── paypalService.js
```

Payment Router ተጠቃሚውን ወደ ተገቢው gateway ይመራል።

Example:

```text
User Location / Choice

        ↓

Payment Router

        ↓

Ethiopia → Telebirr

International → Paddle / PayPal
```

