# Design Principle

Payment gateway መምረጥ ብቻ ሳይሆን፣ system architecture በቀላሉ gateway ለመቀየር እንዲችል ይደረጋል።

Priority:

1. Stable service
2. Secure payment verification
3. Good user experience
4. Future international scalability

መሆን አለበት።
